    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.size
      value: 24
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[0].Text
      value: As you're walking through the village, someone sneaks up behind you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[1].Text
      value: Hiyah! Take that, fishman!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[2].Text
      value: Did you just hit me with a stick?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[3].Text
      value: Yeah haha, what are you gonna do about it? Go home and cry? Cry baby,
        haha!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[4].Text
      value: You have no clue who you just messed with... Child...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[5].Text
      value: Prepare to die...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[6].Text
      value: "Stop, meow! You can\u2019t hurt a child! God! Stop him!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[7].Text
      value: "Killing the child for hitting you with a stick doesn\u2019t seem like
        a very mature thing to do. Also the rats might not take well to it and won\u2019t
        give you your reward."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[8].Text
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[9].Text
      value: Fine then...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[10].Text
      value: Hey, kid. Come here...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[11].Text
      value: <act>whisper</act> <act>whisper</act> <act>whisper</act>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[12].Text
      value: Wha-
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[13].Text
      value: What do you mean?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[14].Text
      value: You're so horrible!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[15].Text
      value: Wahhhhh!!!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[16].Text
      value: What did you say to him, meow?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[17].Text
      value: Nothing much, just telling him how it is.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[18].Text
      value: "So, why don\u2019t <i>you</i> run home and cry to mommy, huh?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[19].Text
      value: Wahhhhh!!!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[20].Text
      value: "After facing this vicious adversary, Gillbert, you have learned the
        skill \u201CMock\u201D."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[21].Text
      value: Nice.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[22].Text
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[23].Text
      value: Hmmm, maybe I should be insulting more kids...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
